    },
    {
      "claim": "Overall, L5 is mixed and not query-specific; it does not overturn the high prediction, and unresolved efflux/metabolism uncertainty is captured by moderate confidence and evidence gaps rather than by a low prediction.",
      "card_ids": ["C242","C246","C250","C254","C247","C230"]
